  "shapeMatchesBBW": "The AF Equipment Contract structure matches every published BBW detail: 5 groups (Details / Abstract Info / Payment Info / Accounting Info / Reports); `Recurring Payments` in place of `Recurring Expenses`; NO `Capital Lease Test` under Accounting Info although `ASC 842 Test` is present; Reports renamed `Equipment Contract Reports`. Since AF has never rendered this root, that shape is platform-seeded, not a BBW customisation."
